1
00:00:00,717 --> 00:00:03,051
As Uke comes round
to grab both of your wrists

2
00:00:03,052 --> 00:00:04,799
draw him in towards you

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,061
so his body comes completely
all the way around you,

4
00:00:08,062 --> 00:00:09,704
as he grabs the other wrist

5
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,427
lower your weight

6
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:12,668
raise your arms up

7
00:00:13,169 --> 00:00:15,648
come out to the space controlling his wrist,

8
00:00:16,249 --> 00:00:17,816
as you do so cut down

9
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:20,771
move around the front of his body
controlling his elbow.

10
00:00:20,972 --> 00:00:23,887
Continue spiraling around the front
towards his head,

11
00:00:24,088 --> 00:00:25,145
sit down

12
00:00:25,746 --> 00:00:29,076
as you do so place his shoulder
in between the knees

13
00:00:29,777 --> 00:00:32,577
the hand which is controlling
the elbow raise up

14
00:00:32,578 --> 00:00:34,582
and switch to control his wrist,

15
00:00:34,583 --> 00:00:35,910
place against your body

16
00:00:35,911 --> 00:00:39,273
turn slightly towards his head for the pin.

